		{
			dependencies: ["43A395FB96AAE476"]
			description: [
				"As this is the proof of concept for the modpack, there is very little implementation when it comes to preventing your progression, even though that's a vital part of the pack's identity."
				""
				"So, for the purposes of this test, please don't craft any core modded progression outside of what is allowed in this questline! Of course, you can use modded amenities, but use discretion. Thank you!"
			]
			icon: {
