		{
			dependencies: ["43A395FB96AAE476"]
			description: ["Automatically bound to &lZ&r on the keyboard is your Dodge Roll ability! You innately start with 2 dodge rolls, which have a slight cooldown. While rolling, you are immune to damage, so try to learn how to take advantage of this during combat!"]
