		{
			dependencies: ["4CF416E3A1469824"]
			description: [
				"In order to assist you with setting up your infrastructure, we've granted access to Integrated Dynamics a little bit earlier than we intend to in the final product. You don't have to use it in all of your automation, but it's required for a vital piece of the puzzle later down the line."
				""
