		{
			dependencies: ["05BABE49D37904E5"]
			description: [
				"In order to take full advantage of the incredible properties of Menril, you'll need to properly process it first. By placing a Squeezer's fluid end next to a Drying Basin, you'll be able to create solid blocks of Crystallized Menril, which is vital for creating various pieces of infrastructure."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"P.S. The Squeezer can be reset by activating it with a redstone signal. If you plop down 2 armor stands on top of it, this action will fling them up into the air, instantly squeezing whatever is in the machine."
			]
