		{
			dependencies: ["2911541746862D7A"]
			description: ["In order to utilize the cables that allow for item/fluid/energy mobility, we must first talk about Variable Cards. They serve a simple purpose: indicating a value that activates importers/exporters for our interfaces. I know that sounds confusing to the layman, but trust me, it's not that bad once you get started. Just make em!"]
			icon: "integrateddynamics:variable"
			id: "2CD0505DE2CBD530"
			rewards: [{
				id: "4F382D62DA00F642"
