			title: "Variable Cards"
			x: 2.5d
			y: 7.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["2CD0505DE2CBD530"]
			description: [
				"In order to best convey what I mean by how simple these tunnels can be, create an Importer and an Interface of the same kind. Place the Importer on the container you wish to take from, the Interface on the container you wish to move to, then connect the two with logic cables."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"Then, insert the Variable Card in the topmost option when right clicking the Importer, which should be \"Import all X\", which is asking for a Boolean. By adding the Variable Card into that slot, which is set to 'true' by default, the Importer is now moving all objects from the container it's connected to into the system designated by the Interface. Neat, right?"
			]
			id: "42C6437D9E707DA8"
			tasks: [
