		{
			dependencies: ["499DB42A7E025198"]
			description: [
				"Once you have all the components required by this quest (and at least 1 of the 2 mana generating flora), you're ready to set up your first mana generating setup!"
				"First, place the flora, then the spreader on top of the flora, then the mana pool within the spreader's line of sight."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"Then, right click the Mana Spreader with your Wand of the Forest, and right click the Mana Pool right after. This will point the spreader in the pool's direction. Then, depending on the generating flora you chose, either give it flammable fuel or put water around it. Presto, now you have mana!"
			]
